{"video":"wFm0_B-VLs0","lines":[{"t":[0,6.8],"en":"Bijon for men? Bijon for men? Bijon for men?"},{"t":[9.3,12.8],"en":"Hey, Annabelle. Hey, Joey. Did you hear about the new guy?"},{"t":[13.1,16],"en":"Who? Nobody knows his name. Me and the girls"},{"t":[16,18.1],"en":"just call him the hombre man."},{"t":[27.8,29.8],"en":"Hombre."},{"t":[34.1,36.1],"en":"What's he doing in my section?"},{"t":[36.6,38.6],"en":"I guess he doesn't know."},{"t":[38.6,40.6],"en":"Well, he's gonna."},{"t":[41.4,43.6],"en":"I'll see you a little later, okay?"},{"t":[46.6,48.6],"en":"Hey, how you doing?"},{"t":[48.6,50.6],"en":"Morning."},{"t":[50.6,55.3],"en":"Listen, I know you're new, but it's kind of understood"},{"t":[55.3,58.1],"en":"that everything from young men's to the escalator"},{"t":[58.1,59.6],"en":"is, uh, my territory."},{"t":[61.1,62.1],"en":"Your territory, huh?"},{"t":[62.1,62.6],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[64.6,65.6],"en":"Bijon for men?"},{"t":[65.6,66.1],"en":"No, thanks."},{"t":[66.1,67.1],"en":"Hombre."},{"t":[68.1,69.6],"en":"Yeah, all right."},{"t":[76.6,77.9],"en":"You were saying."},{"t":[79.9,81.9],"en":"Listen, I was wondering if maybe after work"},{"t":[81.9,83.9],"en":"you and I could go out and grab a cup of coffee."},{"t":[83.9,86.7],"en":"Actually, I sort of have a plan."},{"t":[86.7,87.2],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[91.7,92.7],"en":"You ready, Annabelle?"},{"t":[94.7,95.2],"en":"You bet."},{"t":[98,99.2],"en":"Maybe some other time."},{"t":[99.2,99.7],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[110.7,111.5],"en":"Howdy."},{"t":[114.5,115.5],"en":"Give me a box of juice."},{"t":[119,120.5],"en":"Well, they switched me over to hombre."},{"t":[121.5,123.5],"en":"Well, maybe it's because of the way you're dressed."},{"t":[125.5,128],"en":"Or maybe it's because this guy's doing so good,"},{"t":[128,129.5],"en":"they want to put more people on it."},{"t":[129.5,131.3],"en":"You should see this guy, Chandler."},{"t":[131.3,133],"en":"He goes through, like, two bottles a day now."},{"t":[135.2,135.8],"e